Derived works generated from the vendored material (also GPLv3)
--------------------------------------------------------------

  src/main/resources/forwarding.p4info.json   p4c-emitted P4Runtime schema
  src/main/resources/forwarding.json          p4c-emitted bmv2 device config
  src/main/scala/generated/forwarding.scala   typegen-generated Scala types

    These are produced from p4/forwarding.p4 by `gen.sh` and are committed so the
    demo builds and runs without a P4 toolchain. Regenerating them requires p4c
    1.2.5.15 and P4R-Type's typegen (see gen.sh).

